
# OPEN SOURCE

## Open Source

- Open-source software has source code that can be viewed and often modified according to its licence.

- GitHub contains a huge amount of open-source software.

- I can learn by looking at real projects.

- I can contribute by:

    - Fixing bugs
    - Adding features
    - Improving documentation
    - Writing tests
    - Reporting issues
    - Reviewing code

- Forks and Pull Requests are commonly used when contributing.

